{"strongs": "H3083", "word": "יְהוֺנָתָן", "translit": "ye.ho.na.tan", "root": "הוד", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "hath given", "definition": "יְהוֺנָתָן , יוֺנָתָן proper name, masculine ᵐ5 Ἰωναθαν through-out, with occasional variant reading ( ׳ י hath given ; compare אֶלְנָתָן , נְתַנְיָהוּ , נְתַנְאֵל & references, Temanite רמננתן Hal RÉJ 1884, ix. 7 f. Nbr Stud. Bib. i. 211 ; Sabean והבאום , Hal 10 ) — 1. ׳ יְהוֺ son of Saul 1Sam 14:6 ; 1Sam 14:8 ; 1Sam 18:1 (twice in verse) + 40 t. 1 Samuel; 2Sam 1:4 + 18 t. 2 Samuel; 1Chr 8:33 ; 1Chr 8:34 ; 1Chr 9:39 ; 1Chr 9:40 = ׳ יוֺ 1Sam 13:2 ; 1Sam 13:3 + 27 t. 1 Samuel; 1Chr 10:2 . 2. ׳ יְהוֺ son of Abiathar 2Sam 15:27 ; 2Sam 15:36 ; 2Sam 17:17 ; 2Sam 17:20 = ׳ יוֺ 1Kgs 1:42 ; 1Kgs 1:43 . 3. ׳ יְהוֺ nephew of David 2Sam 21:21 = 1Chr 20:7 apparently: called Jonadab 2Sam 13:3 ff. where ᵐ5 L Ἰωναθαν , compare יהונדב 2. 4. ׳ יְהוֺ ; דּוֺד of David, i.e. his uncle? 1Chr 27:32 . 5. ׳ יְהוֺ one of David's heroes 2Sam 23:32 (compare Dr ) = יוֺנָתָן 1Chr 11:34 . 6. ׳ יְהוֺ one of David's treasurers 1Chr 27:25 . 7. ׳ יְהוֺ Scribe Jer 37:15 ; Jer 37:20 . Jer 38:26 . 8. Levites \\ \\ a. ׳ יְהוֺ 2Chr 17:8 \\ \\ b. ׳ יוֺ Neh 12:35 . 9. ׳ יְהוֺ a priest Neh 12:18 . 10. ׳ יְהוֺ priest to the tribe of Dan, son of Gershom Judg 18:30 . 11. ׳ יוֺ a Judaite captain, after fall of Jerusalem Jer 40:8 . 12. ׳ יוֺ a Judaite 1Chr 2:32 ; 1Chr 2:33 . 13. ׳ יוֺ father of Ebed Ezra 8:6 . 14. ׳ יוֺ son of Asahel Ezra 10:15 . 15. ׳ יוֺ a priest Neh 12:14 . 16. ׳ יוֺ a son of Joiada Neh 12:11 (twice in verse) apparently = יְהוֺחָנָן 2.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2113')\">BDB2113</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3083')\">H3083</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H3129')\">H3129</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2112')\">BDB2112</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2114')\">BDB2114</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>יְהוֺנָתָן</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>יוֺנָתָן</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Ἰωναθαν</grk> through-out, with occasional variant reading (<bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <highlight>hath given</highlight>; compare <bdbheb>אֶלְנָתָן</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>נְתַנְיָהוּ</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>נְתַנְאֵל</bdbheb> &amp; references, Temanite <bdbheb>רמננתן</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hal')\">Hal<sup>RÉJ 1884, ix. 7 f.</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Nbr')\">Nbr<sup>Stud. Bib. i. 211</sup></lookup>; Sabean <bdbheb>והבאום</bdbheb>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hal')\">Hal<sup>10</sup></lookup>) — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יְהוֺ</bdbheb> son of Saul <ref ref=\"1Sam 14:6\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(9,14,6)\">1Sam 14:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 14:8\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(9,14,8)\">1Sam 14:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 18:1\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(9,18,1)\">1Sam 18:1</ref> (twice in verse) + 40 t. 1 Samuel; <ref ref=\"2Sam 1:4\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(10,1,4)\">2Sam 1:4</ref> + 18 t. 2 Samuel; <ref ref=\"1Chr 8:33\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(13,8,33)\">1Chr 8:33</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 8:34\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(13,8,34)\">1Chr 8:34</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 9:39\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(13,9,39)\">1Chr 9:39</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 9:40\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"40\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"40\" onclick=\"bcv(13,9,40)\">1Chr 9:40</ref> = <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 13:2\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(9,13,2)\">1Sam 13:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 13:3\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(9,13,3)\">1Sam 13:3</ref> + 27 t. 1 Samuel; <ref ref=\"1Chr 10:2\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(13,10,2)\">1Chr 10:2</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יְהוֺ</bdbheb> son of Abiathar <ref ref=\"2Sam 15:27\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(10,15,27)\">2Sam 15:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 15:36\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(10,15,36)\">2Sam 15:36</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 17:17\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(10,17,17)\">2Sam 17:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 17:20\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(10,17,20)\">2Sam 17:20</ref> = <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 1:42\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"42\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"42\" onclick=\"bcv(11,1,42)\">1Kgs 1:42</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 1:43\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"43\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"43\" onclick=\"bcv(11,1,43)\">1Kgs 1:43</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יְהוֺ</bdbheb> nephew of David <ref ref=\"2Sam 21:21\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(10,21,21)\">2Sam 21:21</ref> = <ref ref=\"1Chr 20:7\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(13,20,7)\">1Chr 20:7</ref> apparently: called Jonadab <ref ref=\"2Sam 13:3\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(10,13,3)\">2Sam 13:3</ref>ff. where <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb><reflink><sup>L</sup></reflink></lookup> <grk>Ἰωναθαν</grk>, compare <bdbheb>יהונדב</bdbheb> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יְהוֺ</bdbheb>; <bdbheb>דּוֺד</bdbheb> of David, i.e. his uncle? <ref ref=\"1Chr 27:32\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(13,27,32)\">1Chr 27:32</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יְהוֺ</bdbheb> one of David's heroes <ref ref=\"2Sam 23:32\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(10,23,32)\">2Sam 23:32</ref> (compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup>) = <bdbheb>יוֺנָתָן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 11:34\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(13,11,34)\">1Chr 11:34</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>6.</b> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יְהוֺ</bdbheb> one of David's treasurers <ref ref=\"1Chr 27:25\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(13,27,25)\">1Chr 27:25</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>7.</b> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יְהוֺ</bdbheb> Scribe <ref ref=\"Jer 37:15\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(24,37,15)\">Jer 37:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 37:20\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(24,37,20)\">Jer 37:20</ref>. <ref ref=\"Jer 38:26\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(24,38,26)\">Jer 38:26</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>8.</b> Levites <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יְהוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 17:8\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(14,17,8)\">2Chr 17:8</ref> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 12:35\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,35)\">Neh 12:35</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>9.</b> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יְהוֺ</bdbheb> a priest <ref ref=\"Neh 12:18\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,18)\">Neh 12:18</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>10.</b> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יְהוֺ</bdbheb> priest to the tribe of Dan, son of Gershom <ref ref=\"Judg 18:30\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"18\" 